    "title": "LA Times Crossword 30 Jun 26, Tuesday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bill Butler ,\n1 days ago 57A “Never mind!,” or what could be said about 17-, 24-, 35-, or 48-Across : SCRATCH THAT!. “Heated Rivalry” is a Canadian TV drama that is based on the “Game Changers” series of books by Rachel Reid. The story follows a decade-long secret romance between professional hockey rivals Shane Hollander and Ilya Rozanov, played by Hudson Williams and Connor Storrie. In honor of the international success of the show, Williams and Storrie served as torchbearers for the 2026 Winter Olympics in Italy, carrying the Olympic flame through the town of Feltre. In the show, their characters competed in a fictionized version of the Winter Games. Read full article",
